          <title>Discharge Instructions &amp; Follow-up</title>
          <text>
            <list>
              <item>Activity: No heavy lifting &gt; 10 lbs or strenuous exertion for 2 weeks. May shower after 48 hours; do not submerge incisions in water (no baths/swimming).</item>
              <item>Wound Care: Keep incisions clean and dry. Steri-strips will fall off spontaneously in 7-10 days.</item>
              <item>Follow-up: Post-op clinic visit with Dr. Jenkins in 10-14 days (Call 212-555-7010 to schedule).</item>
              <item>Red Flags: Call immediately or go to nearest ED for fever &gt; 101°F, intractable vomiting, worsening abdominal pain, or redness/purulent drainage from incisions.</item>
            </list>
          </text>
        </section>
